12
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,260
Thank you for joining us.

13
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:56,880
So please tell us, why did you decide to open a café?

14
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:03,140
Well, we saw the opportunity to offer something a little special and different from

15
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:08,740
other establishments. Cafés certainly are a very competitive market sector.

16
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:15,280
There are more than plenty in our city and we felt they are all rather similar to

17
