24
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:46,960
We saw other cafes with cats in them, so we thought, why not rabbits?

25
00:01:47,380 --> 00:01:50,200
People love rabbits, they are very cute animals.

26
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:51,800
But is it safe?

27
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:56,800
Do the rabbits ever bite people or do any customers ever hurt the rabbits?

28
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:00,920
It's perfectly safe for both the rabbits and our customers.

29
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:04,900
are very peaceful and certainly do not bite.

30
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:10,800
Furthermore, our rabbits are regularly cleaned and have all received the required

31
