49
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:19,680
I wish I could buy more organic produce from here, but I find the kids don't like

50
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:24,000
it. I don't know about yours, but mine are all about junk food.

51
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,640
Oh, trust me.

52
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,980
I know exactly how you feel.

53
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:30,000
My children are the same.

54
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:34,460
What is it with kids these days and all that junk food they eat?

55
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,120
I think it's all that advertising on TV.

56
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:39,940
That's where they get it.

57
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,600
Yes, it must be.

58
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:46,080
My children see something on TV and they immediately want it.

59
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:50,040
It's like they don't realize it's just an advertisement.

60
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:55,940
Right, and practically everything that's advertised for children is unhealthy

61
00:04:55,940 --> 00:05:02,520
processed foods. No surprise then, it becomes a battle for us parents to feed our

62
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:05,040
children ordinary fruit and vegetables.

63
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:06,840
That's just the thing.

64
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:11,880
One never sees ordinary ingredients being advertised on TV.

65
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:14,420
It's never a carrot or a peach.

66
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:18,160
It's always some garbage like chocolate covered sweets.

67
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:24,980
So unhealthy. Exactly, and these big food corporations have so much money to spend

68
00:05:24,980 --> 00:05:30,020
on clever tactics designed to make young children want to buy their products.

69
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,480
Children never stand a chance.

70
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,100
It's really not fair.

71
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,640
You are so right.

72
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:41,800
When we were children, we barely had any junk food available, and we turned out just

73
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:45,980
fine. Yes, my parents don't understand any of it.

74
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:50,520
