75
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:54,060
Their world was so different back when they were young.

76
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:57,260
I don't know what will happen to the next generation.

77
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,640
The world is going crazy.

